#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:439
msgid "Existential quantifier: If §0 is a predicate, then\n"
"§1 is the statement that *exactly one* element §2 in §3 (more precisely: of type §4)\n"
"exists for which the statement §5 is true.\n"
"The statement therefore has two parts: first, such an §6 exists, and second, §7 is unique.\n"
"## §8 as a proof goal\n"
"\n"
"To prove a statement of the form §9, first construct a suitable element §10 and\n"
"then use the §11 tactic (§12), usually immediately followed by §13.\n"
"The proof goal should then have the following form:\n"
"\n"
