#. §13: `not_forall`
#. §14: `not_exists`
#. §15: `rw`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:373
msgid "The tactic §0 or §1 (§2, §3, §4)  pushes negation past quantifiers:\n"
"\n"
"| before       | after      |\n"
"|:------------ |:-------------|\n"
"| §5  | §6  |\n"
"| §7  | §8  |\n"
"\n"
"In nested expressions, it pushes the negation §9 as far to the right as possible.\n"
"For example, the proof goal\n"
"§10\n"
"with §11\n"
"§12\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and relatives\n"
"\n"
"The two lemmas §13 and §14 can be applied individually with §15."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `obtain`
